---
import Container from "../shared/Container.astro";
import Paragraph from "../shared/Paragraph.astro";
import Title from "../shared/Title.astro";
---

<section class="relative py-16 md:py-20" id="our-services">
    <Container className="space-y-12">
        <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4">
            <Title>
                How We Help
            </Title>
            <Paragraph>
                Three pillars of AI excellence — from configuring your agent environment to measuring real outcomes.
            </Paragraph>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
            <!-- Block 1: Harness Engineering -->
            <div id="harness" class="p-5 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg shadow-lg shadow-box-shadow relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-600">1</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading-1">Harness Engineering</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-indigo-600 font-medium">Tools + Context + Instructions = Results</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.42 15.17l-5.384 3.179 1.03-5.985L2.1 7.58l6.03-.877L11.42 1.5l2.77 5.203 6.03.877-4.966 4.784 1.03 5.985-5.384-3.179z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Agent environment audit & optimization</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">We analyze your current setup and identify configuration gaps that limit agent effectiveness</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75a4.5 4.5 0 01-4.884 4.484c-1.076-.091-2.264.071-2.95.904l-7.152 8.684a2.548 2.548 0 11-3.586-3.586l8.684-7.152c.833-.686.995-1.874.904-2.95a4.5 4.5 0 016.336-4.486l-3.276 3.276a3.004 3.004 0 002.25 2.25l3.276-3.276c.256.565.398 1.192.398 1.852z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Tool & MCP server configuration</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">The right tools connected the right way — code search, LSP, documentation, custom integrations</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 016 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0110.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 016 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 018.25 20.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 013.75 18v-2.25zM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0120.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0118 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0113.5 18v-2.25z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Context management strategy</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">Agents need the right information at the right time — we design what context flows where</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 6.375c0 2.278-3.694 4.125-8.25 4.125S3.75 8.653 3.75 6.375m16.5 0c0-2.278-3.694-4.125-8.25-4.125S3.75 4.097 3.75 6.375m16.5 0v11.25c0 2.278-3.694 4.125-8.25 4.125s-8.25-1.847-8.25-4.125V6.375m16.5 0v3.75m-16.5-3.75v3.75m16.5 0v3.75C20.25 16.153 16.556 18 12 18s-8.25-1.847-8.25-4.125v-3.75m16.5 0c0 2.278-3.694 4.125-8.25 4.125s-8.25-1.847-8.25-4.125" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Knowledge graph experiments (GraphRAG)</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">Structuring codebase knowledge for more effective agent reasoning</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Block 2: Skills Development -->
            <div id="skills" class="p-5 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg shadow-lg shadow-box-shadow relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-green-600">2</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading-1">Skills Development</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-green-600 font-medium">Skills Are Software — Build, Test, Iterate</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 6.75L22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3l-4.5 16.5" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Team-specific skills</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">Codified domain knowledge, project conventions, and architectural patterns unique to your codebase</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Universal coding skills</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">Proven patterns for testing, refactoring, and code quality that work across projects</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Skill testing & iteration</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">Activation testing confirms a skill loads. Outcome testing proves it works. We do both.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.5 21L3 16.5m0 0L7.5 12M3 16.5h13.5m0-13.5L21 7.5m0 0L16.5 12M21 7.5H7.5" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Distribution across teams</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">Skills versioned, shared, and maintained like any other engineering artifact</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Block 3: From Meeting to Working Software -->
            <div id="meeting-to-code" class="p-5 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg shadow-lg shadow-box-shadow relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-600">3</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading-1">From Meeting to Working Software</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 font-medium">Shorter Path from Decisions to Code</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Meeting → Design Document</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">We're shortening the path from team discussions to design documents with sound architectural decisions</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Autonomous implementation with verification</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">AI agents execute from precise specifications with deterministic verification at every step</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182m0-4.991v4.99" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Deterministic feedback loops</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">When verification fails, agents receive structured feedback and iterate autonomously</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-heading-1 font-semibold text-sm">Continuous quality gates</p>
                            <p class="text-heading-3 text-xs">Architecture compliance, test suites, and code standards checked on every change</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Container>
</section>
